## Each tube counts 0-7 in binary using top/middle/bottom horizontals.
## Phase offset of 1 between adjacent tubes makes the count march rightward.
## 0=blank 1=top 2=mid 3=top+mid 4=bot 5=top+bot 6=mid+bot 7=all three
